---@field revisionId? string Output only. The revision ID of the mapping rule. A new revision is committed whenever the mapping rule is changed in any way. The format is an 8-character hexadecimal string.
---@field singleColumnChange? gcp.datamigration_v1.SingleColumnChange Optional. Rule to specify how a single column is converted.
---@field filter? gcp.datamigration_v1.MappingRuleFilter Required. The rule filter
