---@field dumpType? gcp.datamigration_v1.MigrationJobDumpTypeEnum|string Optional. The type of the data dump. Supported for MySQL to CloudSQL for MySQL migrations only.
---@field destinationDatabase? gcp.datamigration_v1.DatabaseType The database engine type and provider of the destination.
