---@field conversionWorkspace? gcp.datamigration_v1.ConversionWorkspaceInfo The conversion workspace used by the migration.
---@field sqlserverHomogeneousMigrationJobConfig? gcp.datamigration_v1.SqlServerHomogeneousMigrationJobConfig Optional. Configuration for SQL Server homogeneous migration.
---@field objectsConfig? gcp.datamigration_v1.MigrationJobObjectsConfig Optional. The objects that need to be migrated.
---@field state? gcp.datamigration_v1.MigrationJobStateEnum|string The current migration job state.
---@field destination? string Required. The resource name (URI) of the destination connection profile.
---@field displayName? string The migration job display name.
---@field satisfiesPzs? boolean Output only. Reserved for future use.
---@field type? gcp.datamigration_v1.MigrationJobTypeEnum|string Required. The migration job type.
---@field mysqlHomogeneousConfig? gcp.datamigration_v1.MySqlHomogeneousConfig Optional. Configuration for MySQL homogeneous migration.
---@field requestId? string Optional. A unique ID used to identify the request. If the server receives two requests with the same ID, then the second request is ignored. It is recommended to always set this value to a UUID. The ID must contain only letters (a-z, A-Z), numbers (0-9), underscores (_), and hyphens (-). The maximum length is 40 characters.
---@field updateMask? string Required. Field mask is used to specify the fields to be overwritten by the update in the conversion workspace resource.
