---Configuration for homogeneous migration to Cloud SQL for SQL Server.
---@class gcp.datamigration_v1.SqlServerHomogeneousMigrationJobConfig
---@field databaseBackups? gcp.datamigration_v1.SqlServerDatabaseBackupList Required. Backup details per database in Cloud Storage.
